# Scene1-4-4

; ========================================
; ●シーン1‐4-4
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:6_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_9_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:刚刚差点被亚里沙杀死的艾玛<br>来到食堂。|#0104Adv04_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:发生那种事以后不可能还有食欲，但可能“要遵守规定”<br>这一点已经在艾玛心里扎根，她还是来了。|#0104Adv04_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:稀奇的是，<br>此时可可和玛格就在食堂内。|#0104Adv04_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们应该一直都是有意识地错开时间来吃饭，<br>而今天因为艾玛来晚了，<br>于是阴差阳错在同一时段来到了食堂。|#0104Adv04_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当艾玛尴尬地在餐桌前坐下时，<br>随后而来的梅露露也出现了。|#0104Adv04_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:我刚才看到了亚里沙小姐。|#0104Adv04_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，嗯、嗯，我也……看到了。|#0104Adv04_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:想起几乎要完全化作异形的亚里沙的模样，<br>艾玛难受得低下了头。|#0104Adv04_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙小姐，看起来非常，非常难受……<br>日子一天天过去，她的心神消耗越来越重。|#0104Adv04_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我们……就什么都帮不了她吗……|#0104Adv04_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:我跟她聊了几句，<br>她的状态应该稳定了不少。|#0104Adv04_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她还跟我约定，说自己不会变成魔女。|#0104Adv04_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:真、真的吗！？|#0104Adv04_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆鼻で笑う

[PrintTextModified Text:——哼。|#0104Adv04_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然挑了一个跟她们相隔挺远的位置坐下，<br>但看来可可两人一直留意她们的对话。<br>可可仿佛在落井下石似的嗤笑道。|#0104Adv04_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:你蠢不蠢？<br>这种随口说说的约定你也信？|#0104Adv04_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我可不敢信。她那副样子，看着就绝对会变成魔女。<br>说不定她已经准备乘机偷袭杀人哦～？|#0104Adv04_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙才不是那种人……！|#0104Adv04_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:哎哟～还在信什么手拉手好朋友吗？<br>恶心！！|#0104Adv04_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:反正到最后所有人都会想着谁死了都行就自己不想死，<br>为了活命就只能先下手把对方杀死，<br>然后互相厮杀。|#0104Adv04_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:到那时我们心地善良的艾玛亲<br>会乖乖地任人宰杀是吗？<br>嘴里还要说什么这都是为了朋友～|#0104Adv04_Coco006| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1,ArmR6,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:要是这样的话，<br>那人家也要跟艾玛亲做朋友～！求你了嘛～！|#0104Adv04_Coco007| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:嬉皮笑脸地说完这些讨喜话后，<br>可可重重地敲了敲桌面。|#0104Adv04_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; テーブルを叩く音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_32 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:这个犹如一团恶意的巨大声响，<br>吓得艾玛和梅露露打了个哆嗦。|#0104Adv04_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:简直令人作呕！！<br>所有人都是敌人！！你们怎么还没注意到这一点！！|#0104Adv04_Coco008| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……不、不对哦，我们，不是敌人。|#0104Adv04_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:和睦相处肯定是最好的。<br>这样肯定就能找到一条活路……|#0104Adv04_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:什么活路啊？<br>我们的结局不就只有要么死要么变魔女吗！|#0104Adv04_Coco009| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1,ArmR10,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:我不想死！<br>不想死！不想死！|#0104Adv04_Coco010| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你们给我去死行不行！！<br>除了我以外其他人全给我消失啊！！|#0104Adv04_Coco011| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:可可，你先冷静一下。|#0104Adv04_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格站了起来，<br>向怒火中烧的可可走去。|#0104Adv04_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可正抱着头不停地颤抖。|#0104Adv04_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Fearful1,ArmR10,ArmL8
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:说不定她会来杀我……<br>我说了她很多坏话，<br>还故意惹怒她……|#0104Adv04_Coco012| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说不定她心里恨我，要来杀死我……|#0104Adv04_Coco013| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好怕……！好害怕，我好害怕，谁来救救我！！|#0104Adv04_Coco014| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊，得早点想想怎样自卫才好。|#0104Adv04_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（连玛格也……不对，<br>　玛格她从一开始就不相信任何人）|#0104Adv04_Ema007|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可因恐惧而陷入恐慌状态，<br>玛格一边摩挲她的后背一边把她扶了起来。|#0104Adv04_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们走吧。现在还是一个人待着会好些。|#0104Adv04_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格斜眼朝艾玛和梅露露那边<br>看了看。|#0104Adv04_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不单单是亚里沙，<br>没有人知道谁会在什么时候动手杀人。|#0104Adv04_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格和可可离开了食堂。|#0104Adv04_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我们跟玛格还有可可已经<br>　无法互相理解了吗……）|#0104Adv04_Ema008|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一直以来，<br>艾玛都觉得自己和玛格还有可可之间有一条无法跨越的沟壑。|#0104Adv04_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:……艾玛小姐！|#0104Adv04_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这里……就交给我来处理，好吗。|#0104Adv04_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……？<br>梅、梅露露……？|#0104Adv04_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露眼里渗出点点泪花。|#0104Adv04_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:这样……一点都不好！|#0104Adv04_Meruru007| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以……玛格小姐跟可可小姐，<br>然后还有亚里沙小姐跟奈叶香小姐……|#0104Adv04_Meruru008| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就算只是一点点也好，<br>我也想试着把大家的心维系起来。|#0104Adv04_Meruru009| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:你、你想怎么办？<br>梅露露……|#0104Adv04_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:我觉得她们俩的心灵正承受着摧残。|#0104Adv04_Meruru010| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以我要先让玛格小姐和可可小姐<br>内心平静下来才行……|#0104Adv04_Meruru011| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:既然决定了我就要马上准备才行……！<br>详细情况我以后再告诉你！|#0104Adv04_Meruru012| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Meruru Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:说完，梅露露小跑着，<br>跟在玛格和可可的后头离开了。|#0104Adv04_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……梅露露是在尽自己所能<br>做力所能及的事……|#0104Adv04_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我呢……我又能做到什么……？|#0104Adv04_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:没有人能为这个问题作出回答。|#0104Adv04_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv

@GotoModified Path:Act01_Chapter04/Act01_Chapter04_Adv05 SoftReset:true

